WEBVTT

00:08.626 --> 00:10.753
The future has been determined.

00:11.795 --> 00:15.322
And nobody can change that.

00:46.597 --> 00:47.564
The future...

00:48.599 --> 00:49.588
...is always...

00:50.634 --> 00:51.999
...but one.

00:55.105 --> 00:59.056
Episode 17
Wish

01:19.163 --> 01:23.759
Sister, your dreams have always come true.

01:23.834 --> 01:26.826
These long years since you were born into this world...

01:26.904 --> 01:29.998
...you have been walking only the life of a dreamseer.

01:31.075 --> 01:34.408
Everything repeats itself just as in your dreams.

01:35.446 --> 01:38.006
You know that best, yet...

01:41.251 --> 01:45.779
We dreamseers only see our dreams repeated.

01:46.824 --> 01:50.453
I threw away my hopes long ago, just as you did.

01:50.527 --> 01:51.824
Yet...

01:51.895 --> 01:53.089
Again like this...

01:55.599 --> 01:58.261
You know this girl, don't you?

01:59.670 --> 02:01.194
Kotori Monou.

02:02.172 --> 02:06.108
You, a Dragon of Earth, know about her?

02:06.176 --> 02:09.737
She had the talent to become a dreamseer.

02:09.813 --> 02:12.748
Just as you and I cross into each other's dreams...

02:12.816 --> 02:15.751
...I crossed into her dream, as well.

02:19.656 --> 02:21.089
Kakyou...

02:21.158 --> 02:24.559
If you see my big brother and Kamui, please tell them...

02:25.596 --> 02:27.530
Please tell them...

02:27.598 --> 02:28.826
Please...

02:28.899 --> 02:32.858
But there was nothing that I could do for her.

02:32.936 --> 02:34.369
Just like you.

02:35.406 --> 02:39.365
Anything and everything is just as we see in our dreams.

02:39.443 --> 02:42.879
No matter what we wish for, no matter what we desire...

02:42.946 --> 02:45.278
The future is but one...

02:45.349 --> 02:47.283
And never changes.

02:51.855 --> 02:53.322
My wish...

02:56.393 --> 02:58.054
Huh?

02:58.128 --> 02:59.254
Where is this?

03:00.330 --> 03:03.458
This isn't inside my dream...

03:04.968 --> 03:06.299
That means...

03:06.370 --> 03:08.304
...this is your dream?

03:08.372 --> 03:09.771
Correct...

03:09.840 --> 03:11.273
This is my dream.

03:12.576 --> 03:16.171
Why was I able to come inside your dream?

03:16.246 --> 03:17.213
Why?

03:18.682 --> 03:21.276
Because I wanted to see someone...

03:21.351 --> 03:23.842
My name's Hokuto Sumeragi.

03:23.921 --> 03:25.411
What's yours?

03:25.489 --> 03:26.854
Kakyou...

03:26.924 --> 03:30.121
Kakyou Kuzuki.

03:30.194 --> 03:31.786
Kakyou, huh?

03:31.862 --> 03:33.989
So why have you been alone all this time?

03:34.064 --> 03:35.861
You haven't gone outside of there, either?

03:35.933 --> 03:37.867
Is that of your own will?

03:40.003 --> 03:41.129
It's not?

03:41.205 --> 03:42.536
Then it's easy!

03:42.606 --> 03:44.369
I'll take you out somewhere.

03:44.441 --> 03:46.068
Where do you want to go?

03:46.143 --> 03:47.269
Anywhere.

03:47.344 --> 03:49.175
That's no good!

03:49.246 --> 03:50.941
After all, this is the first date!

03:51.982 --> 03:53.847
I want to see the sea.

03:54.885 --> 03:56.113
The sea?

03:56.186 --> 03:57.517
How about a sea like this?

04:06.196 --> 04:08.630
This is inside my dream.

04:08.699 --> 04:11.964
But the sea in real life is more wonderful than this!

04:12.035 --> 04:15.061
Since we've gotten to know one another well, I want to see you.

04:15.138 --> 04:17.368
Not in our dreams, but the real Kakyou.

04:18.408 --> 04:21.571
I want to see you, too. But...

04:21.645 --> 04:22.805
But?

04:22.880 --> 04:25.007
I can't go outside.

04:25.082 --> 04:26.049
Ever.

04:27.751 --> 04:30.185
Nothing is absolute in this world.

04:30.254 --> 04:31.687
It's all right!

04:31.755 --> 04:34.053
You have Hokuto Sumeragi on your side!

04:35.092 --> 04:36.616
Well, let's go!

04:36.693 --> 04:38.183
Out of there and outside!

04:49.840 --> 04:52.138
My wish...

04:57.114 --> 04:58.775
Is it tough?

04:58.849 --> 05:00.817
I will grant your wish.

05:01.852 --> 05:04.446
I am the only one that can kill you.

05:07.157 --> 05:08.317
Please...

05:08.392 --> 05:10.292
Tell them.

05:10.360 --> 05:11.327
Please.

05:37.220 --> 05:38.312
Kamui...

05:39.356 --> 05:41.824
Kamui, can you hear me?

05:46.430 --> 05:48.990
You have been hurt enough.

05:49.066 --> 05:50.431
In body and soul.

05:51.468 --> 05:53.834
Will you stop wishing now?

05:54.871 --> 05:58.398
If you keep wishing, you're sure to be hurt again.

05:58.475 --> 06:00.500
Learn things you didn't want to know.

06:00.577 --> 06:03.307
See things you didn't want to see.

06:03.380 --> 06:06.372
Even so, will you keep wishing?

06:07.851 --> 06:11.787
I am Kakyou, the dreamseer of the Dragons of Earth.

06:11.855 --> 06:15.382
I know your past and your future from the dreams.

06:16.560 --> 06:18.824
Everything about you...

06:18.895 --> 06:22.797
...has repeated in reality exactly as in the dreams I have had.

06:23.834 --> 06:26.166
I'm sure you will believe me now.

06:27.204 --> 06:31.436
Though there are many things you don't want to believe.

06:31.508 --> 06:33.840
Things you don't want to remember.

06:40.050 --> 06:41.347
Mother!

06:41.418 --> 06:43.409
Go to Tokyo, Kamui.

06:44.454 --> 06:46.513
Your destiny awaits.

06:47.591 --> 06:49.456
Become stronger.

06:49.526 --> 06:52.620
So that you can protect your loved ones.

06:52.696 --> 06:56.257
So that when you hold the Divine Sword in your hands and fight...

06:56.333 --> 06:58.028
...you will not be lost.

06:59.569 --> 07:02.367
Become stronger, Kamui.

07:02.439 --> 07:07.001
That day, the gears of your fate started to turn.

07:07.077 --> 07:08.044
Mother...

07:13.684 --> 07:16.346
Following your mother's last wishes...

07:16.420 --> 07:19.583
...you returned here to Tokyo.

07:22.859 --> 07:24.918
I don't want to be treated like a kid.

07:24.995 --> 07:27.361
I don't intend to follow anyone's orders.

07:29.800 --> 07:31.768
Hurry up and hand it over.

07:35.939 --> 07:37.736
If you want it that badly...

07:41.078 --> 07:44.445
...defeat me and take it away from me.

07:48.785 --> 07:49.752
Wait!

07:50.754 --> 07:55.623
What awaited you in Tokyo was a reunion with past friends.

07:57.194 --> 07:59.321
Um, well... Can it be...

08:00.597 --> 08:02.656
...that you're Kamui?

08:03.734 --> 08:04.701
You are, right?

08:05.702 --> 08:08.671
I'm Kotori from the Togakushi Shrine.

08:08.739 --> 08:09.865
Kotori Monou.

08:11.641 --> 08:13.609
It really is you!

08:13.677 --> 08:16.737
It's been a while, Kamui Shirou.

08:16.813 --> 08:18.405
I was surprised...

08:19.449 --> 08:21.679
Don't mess with me.

08:21.752 --> 08:23.515
I promised you back then...

08:24.988 --> 08:29.482
...that when something happens to you, I'll protect you.

08:31.128 --> 08:33.460
And that won't change, either.

08:33.530 --> 08:34.497
Ever.

08:36.466 --> 08:37.763
I've forgotten.

08:39.102 --> 08:41.036
You should forget it, too.

08:42.439 --> 08:43.406
Kamui...

08:44.407 --> 08:46.932
And don't ever do things you don't have to.

08:48.044 --> 08:50.069
That's our new promise.

08:51.882 --> 08:56.114
You didn't want to involve those two in your own fate.

08:57.154 --> 08:58.451
However...

08:58.522 --> 09:00.752
...your wish would not be granted.

09:07.764 --> 09:10.494
But whether you like it or not...

09:10.567 --> 09:12.865
...the battle has already begun.

09:12.936 --> 09:14.563
The End of the World.

09:14.638 --> 09:16.333
The Promised Day.

09:16.406 --> 09:18.340
Is that what you were talking about?

09:18.408 --> 09:19.397
That's right.

09:19.476 --> 09:21.307
The Final Battle.

09:21.378 --> 09:24.142
We all gathered here for just that purpose.

09:24.214 --> 09:26.842
As members of the Seven Seals.

09:26.917 --> 09:30.011
And so, the new greetings began.

09:30.086 --> 09:32.452
You're the ones who attacked first.

09:32.522 --> 09:34.513
I have no wish to fight you.

09:34.591 --> 09:36.183
Don't mouth off!

09:36.259 --> 09:38.819
I won't forgive anyone
who gets in my way!

09:43.533 --> 09:45.296
Excuse me!

09:45.368 --> 09:48.462
I'm Yuzuriha Nekoi of Mitsumine
Shrine! I'm 14 years old!

09:49.606 --> 09:51.441
Nice to meet you.
The Dragons of Heaven, the Seven Seals...

09:51.441 --> 09:52.738
Best regards for the future!
The Dragons of Heaven, the Seven Seals...

09:52.809 --> 09:55.004
I'm Yuzuriha Nekoi!
...all gathered under you.

09:55.078 --> 09:56.409
This is amazing!

09:56.479 --> 09:59.004
All of these people can see you too, Inuki!

10:00.984 --> 10:04.420
And from the dreamseer named Hinoto...

10:04.487 --> 10:08.583
...you learned just how heavy the destiny upon your shoulders was.

10:15.198 --> 10:19.294
The power to break these barriers and destroy the world.

10:19.369 --> 10:23.829
The ones who lead those powers are called the Seven Angels.

10:24.941 --> 10:29.207
And only the Seven Seals can stop them...

10:29.279 --> 10:32.271
...and protect the Dragons of Heaven.

10:32.349 --> 10:34.613
The Dragons of Heaven, the Seven Seals...

10:34.684 --> 10:37.778
...and the Dragons of Earth, the Seven Angels' battle...

10:37.854 --> 10:40.880
That is the battle for the End of fhe World.

10:41.925 --> 10:44.655
If the Dragons of Earth defeat the Dragons of Heaven...

10:44.728 --> 10:46.457
...the world will be destroyed.

10:47.664 --> 10:50.360
This is the future that I saw.

10:54.771 --> 10:56.170
Kamui...

10:56.239 --> 10:59.333
You can change this future.

11:00.443 --> 11:05.005
Guide the Seven Seals and save us from this future.

11:05.081 --> 11:06.446
Me?

11:06.516 --> 11:09.849
You should already have realized those powers.

11:09.920 --> 11:13.447
The ones that hold the key to the end of this world.

11:13.523 --> 11:18.825
That is why your mother took you as a young child and left Tokyo.

11:18.895 --> 11:20.760
To await your growth.

11:20.830 --> 11:25.494
And to prevent the catastrophes that will now fall upon you...

11:25.568 --> 11:28.093
...she passed away as your Shadow Sacrifice.

11:29.372 --> 11:31.465
I don't care about the future.

11:31.541 --> 11:34.305
I have no interest in saving this world.

11:34.377 --> 11:36.937
Besides, I don't fully trust you, either!

11:37.013 --> 11:39.982
If I have enough power to decide the future...

11:40.050 --> 11:42.951
...why didn't you hurry up and give me the Divine Sword?

11:43.019 --> 11:45.214
If I had the Divine Sword in hand...

11:45.288 --> 11:49.190
...the shrinemaster of Togakushi Shrine wouldn't be where he is!

11:49.259 --> 11:50.385
Am I wrong?

11:51.528 --> 11:54.622
Princess, you can't do anything about it.

11:54.698 --> 11:56.256
He's just a kid.

11:57.300 --> 11:59.928
Besides, nobody'd be able to stand it...

12:00.003 --> 12:02.130
...if they were suddenly handed the world.

12:02.205 --> 12:05.470
Even I think so, and I'm one of the Seven Seals.

12:05.542 --> 12:07.134
You all think the same, right?

12:07.210 --> 12:09.041
Yes, I feel the same way!

12:09.112 --> 12:10.875
Yeah.

12:10.947 --> 12:14.747
Feeling confused after finding out so many things can't be helped.

12:14.818 --> 12:16.285
But it'll be all right.

12:17.287 --> 12:20.484
Kamui still has things he wants to protect.

12:21.591 --> 12:23.286
What you seek to protect...

12:24.461 --> 12:26.656
That was that girl and Fuma.

12:26.730 --> 12:28.960
...and I'm going to learn about the process.

12:30.000 --> 12:34.596
I heard it takes ten, even twenty years to get colors like that.

12:34.671 --> 12:37.139
But I think I want to try.

12:38.308 --> 12:39.502
That's my dream.

12:40.543 --> 12:43.774
Ten... even twenty years...

12:43.847 --> 12:44.814
Yes.

12:48.551 --> 12:50.178
Fuma...

12:50.253 --> 12:55.190
We're finally able to go back to how we used to be...

12:57.160 --> 13:01.062
However, tragedy was already close at hand.

13:02.265 --> 13:03.232
Stop it!

13:03.299 --> 13:05.233
My sister Tohru's death...

13:05.301 --> 13:06.495
Saya's death...

13:07.537 --> 13:09.027
It is all destiny.

13:10.073 --> 13:12.371
I am merely following it myself.

13:12.442 --> 13:13.409
- You can't!
- Hey!

13:13.476 --> 13:15.740
This is my destiny.

13:31.561 --> 13:32.892
- Kotori!
- No!

13:32.962 --> 13:34.088
No!

13:36.366 --> 13:38.527
Kotori, look this way.

13:38.601 --> 13:40.159
You can tell who I am, right?

13:40.236 --> 13:41.464
It's me, Kamui.

13:41.538 --> 13:43.062
Blood...

13:43.139 --> 13:44.538
Lots of blood...

13:44.607 --> 13:46.131
Look at me...

13:46.209 --> 13:47.938
Look at me, Kotori!

13:48.011 --> 13:49.535
Red blood...

13:49.612 --> 13:51.045
Look at me!

13:51.114 --> 13:52.911
Look at me, Kotori!

13:54.184 --> 13:56.084
If you wish for the present...

13:56.152 --> 13:58.620
The future of this human-soiled Earth...

13:58.688 --> 14:01.623
...must be entrusted to the humans themselves.

14:01.691 --> 14:03.158
You must then wish...

14:03.226 --> 14:06.662
...for the aversion of the world's annihilation.

14:06.729 --> 14:08.219
If you wish for revolution...

14:08.298 --> 14:11.961
The world will be lost, and civilization destroyed...

14:12.035 --> 14:17.337
...but the planet known as Earth will surely head towards a new rebirth.

14:17.407 --> 14:19.602
The present or a revolution.

14:19.676 --> 14:22.406
Kamui, you will choose the future.

14:23.446 --> 14:25.311
Your own future...

14:29.052 --> 14:33.079
And you finally chose one of the two.

14:36.860 --> 14:38.191
It seems you've chosen.

14:39.929 --> 14:42.591
The present over a revolution.

14:42.665 --> 14:43.632
Fuma...

14:43.700 --> 14:47.101
One of the Seven Seals, a Dragon of Heaven's future.

14:47.170 --> 14:48.660
You chose.

14:48.738 --> 14:50.296
What's wrong with you?

14:50.373 --> 14:53.137
If you become a Dragon of Heaven...

14:53.209 --> 14:55.677
...it is destiny I become one of Earth.

14:55.745 --> 14:58.942
W-What are you talking about, Fuma?

14:59.015 --> 15:00.505
Two Divine Swords...

15:00.583 --> 15:02.346
Two futures...

15:02.418 --> 15:04.648
I am your twin star.

15:08.358 --> 15:09.347
Fuma...

15:09.425 --> 15:11.893
Do you know what you're doing right now?

15:11.961 --> 15:13.451
Of course.

15:13.530 --> 15:16.397
The Earth longs for a revolution.

15:16.466 --> 15:20.197
A revolution that humans will not get in the way of.

15:21.237 --> 15:26.174
I'll become a Dragon of Earth, kill all of the Dragons of Heaven...

15:26.242 --> 15:28.870
...and wipe out all those who pollute the Earth.

15:28.945 --> 15:31.937
T-There's something wrong with you, Fuma...

15:33.983 --> 15:36.178
This is our destiny.

15:40.190 --> 15:41.418
Big Brother...

15:44.527 --> 15:46.859
Fuma!

15:49.265 --> 15:51.392
Your wish was broken...

15:51.467 --> 15:53.526
You lost everything and were hurt...

15:54.571 --> 15:57.335
But still, you kept wishing.

15:59.542 --> 16:01.203
Fuma...

16:01.277 --> 16:03.677
Can I bring back his old self?

16:03.746 --> 16:07.705
That is one thing that even I do not know.

16:08.751 --> 16:12.380
But if he returns to the identity you know as Fuma...

16:12.455 --> 16:16.619
...he will also be reminded of the fact that he killed that girl.

16:18.027 --> 16:18.994
I see.

16:20.797 --> 16:23.527
But I've decided.

16:23.600 --> 16:27.127
That I'll make sure to bring Fuma back to his old self.

16:28.171 --> 16:30.867
I heard what I wanted to hear.

16:30.940 --> 16:31.907
Thanks.

16:34.611 --> 16:36.977
You say everything is destined...

16:37.046 --> 16:38.479
...but I don't believe it.

16:40.350 --> 16:42.682
I'll decide my own future.

16:44.220 --> 16:45.187
Here.

16:48.024 --> 16:49.514
What's wrong?

16:49.592 --> 16:52.390
If you break me here, I will die.

16:54.764 --> 16:56.857
F-Fuma...

16:56.933 --> 16:58.491
Why...

16:58.568 --> 17:00.126
Why?

17:00.203 --> 17:02.433
You had such a good chance...

17:03.473 --> 17:04.440
...Kamui!

17:07.877 --> 17:09.344
If you want to kill me...

17:10.380 --> 17:11.779
...come at full strength.

17:13.349 --> 17:16.580
You fell to the Kamui of the Dragons of Earth...

17:16.653 --> 17:18.985
...and were unable to create a Barrier.

17:19.055 --> 17:23.116
As well as losing a comrade's life, you were further hurt...

17:23.192 --> 17:25.092
Just as in my dreams.

17:26.129 --> 17:27.892
But still, you keep wishing?

17:28.931 --> 17:32.196
Even if further sorrow awaits you...

17:33.236 --> 17:35.329
What will you do, Kamui?

17:37.040 --> 17:38.234
If now...

17:38.308 --> 17:41.175
...Fuma and I are both the same "Kamui"...

17:41.244 --> 17:43.576
...I'm the only one that can stop him.

17:44.614 --> 17:46.639
I'm not going to worry anymore.

17:46.716 --> 17:49.241
I'll become stronger than him.

17:49.319 --> 17:52.652
Even if you'll hurt him with those powers?

17:53.690 --> 17:54.748
Yeah.

17:54.824 --> 17:56.485
I've decided.

17:56.559 --> 17:58.083
I'll get Fuma back.

18:01.764 --> 18:04.961
The other Kamui that hurts you so much...

18:05.034 --> 18:07.059
...is yourself as well.

18:08.071 --> 18:09.561
Myself?

18:09.639 --> 18:11.504
If you realize that...

18:11.574 --> 18:12.734
Or...

18:12.809 --> 18:14.208
Why?

18:14.277 --> 18:16.609
You're the Dragon of Earth dreamseer.

18:16.679 --> 18:18.613
Why are you telling me all this?

18:19.749 --> 18:22.616
I know how this battle will end.

18:23.653 --> 18:27.316
But even if I know the future, I can't change anything.

18:28.358 --> 18:33.057
That is precisely why I want to believe in that girl's words.

18:50.413 --> 18:51.539
Kotori.

18:57.987 --> 18:59.284
Kotori.

18:59.355 --> 19:00.652
I'm sorry I...

19:02.725 --> 19:05.421
It's nothing you should apologize for, Shirou.

19:05.495 --> 19:07.463
This is the destiny I chose.

19:08.498 --> 19:09.829
To protect me.

19:10.867 --> 19:14.496
I was the one that was supposed to protect you, Kotori.

19:14.570 --> 19:15.832
Don't cry.

19:15.905 --> 19:18.840
I'm always with you.

19:18.908 --> 19:20.671
Inside your heart.

19:21.944 --> 19:24.105
And I'll always keep wishing.

19:25.148 --> 19:27.048
That you, who I love so much...

19:27.116 --> 19:30.142
...will protect the big brother I love so much.

19:33.022 --> 19:35.013
I believe.

19:36.626 --> 19:40.790
That you'll become strong and not let anything beat you.

19:49.672 --> 19:53.073
Besides, the future still hasn't been determined.

19:54.110 --> 19:56.305
The future still...

19:57.713 --> 19:59.578
It hasn't been determined, right?

20:00.616 --> 20:03.881
Of course it hasn't been determined.

20:03.953 --> 20:05.420
I'll believe, too.
